WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.775 line:92% size:92%
Underground, a harmful fungus attacks your crop's root.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:09.300 line:92% size:92%
But two allies arrive: beneficial fungi that defend the root.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:14.192 line:92% size:92%
They colonise the root, take space and food from the pathogen, and control it.

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:20.808 line:92% size:92%
And not only once the problem is there: applied earlier, it protects the root preventively.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:27.000 line:92% size:92%
Together they make NANO-XTINGER 10GW, a microbial fungicide.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:32.069 line:92% size:92%
Its secret: a water-soluble gel that protects the spores for up to two years.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:37.800 line:92% size:92%
In other formulations, the spores sink to the bottom, stay suspended or compact.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:43.101 line:92% size:92%
With NANO-XTINGER, they stay throughout the container: every dose carries the same.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:48.149 line:92% size:92%
Easy to apply, zero days of residue and no resistance build-up.

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:55.380 line:92% size:92%
NANO-XTINGER, by Demeter. Certified organic.
